&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven global experience leading MSAT for commercial biopharmaceutical products, preferably including cell therapy, gene therapy, or other advanced modalities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in process characterization, validation, technology transfer, CPV, process optimization, manufacturing technology, and lifecycle management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
