&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Legend Biotech entered into a global collaboration agreement with Johnson &amp;amp; Johnson to jointly develop and commercialize CARVYKTI® (ciltacabtagene autoleucel; cilta-cel). Through this strategic partnership, we combine complementary expertise and capabilities to advance innovative immunotherapies for patients living with multiple myeloma.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Legend Biotech is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Manager, Workday Compensation and Talent&lt;/strong&gt; as part of the &lt;strong&gt;HR Operations &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; team based in &lt;strong&gt;Bridgewater, NJ.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
